{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness","id":1150942,"title":"Will we get a storyteller vault for Chronicles of Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-19T03:16:32-07:00","id":1150942,"title":"Will we get a storyteller vault for Chronicles of Darkness","content":"I saw that there is a Storyteller vault for Old World Of Darkness. Will we get one for Chronicles of darkness?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T04:06:28-07:00","id":1150947,"title":"","content":"Who knows? There's been no official word on it. Though at this rate it's going to be a very long time (the ST Vault is currently VtM only, not all WoD, and it isn't even all of VtM either since they only just opened it to Dark Ages material so Victorian VtM is still not something you can put up there, let alone WtA) if it does happen.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, WW seems to have given extremely little thought towards supporting the CofD and Exalted while they do things to push the WoD; even at times to the detriment of the other games. Like the current fansite rules from WW limit the artwork (including logos and such) to an approved folder available on their website... which is all WoD material. So a CofD fansite cannot be in compliance with the official fansite guidelines if it even wants to use the logo for the baseline game. If they don't have the concern to let CofD fansites use the gameline skulls in their fansite rules... I highly doubt a far bigger task in the form of a CofD Vault is happening any time soon, if at all (unless WW lets Onyx Path take over this for them).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T07:56:40-07:00","id":1151004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1150947#post1150947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who knows? There's been no official word on it. Though at this rate it's going to be a very long time (the ST Vault is currently VtM only, not all WoD, and it isn't even all of VtM either since they only just opened it to Dark Ages material so Victorian VtM is still not something you can put up there, let alone WtA) if it does happen.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, WW seems to have given extremely little thought towards supporting the CofD and Exalted while they do things to push the WoD; even at times to the detriment of the other games. Like the current fansite rules from WW limit the artwork (including logos and such) to an approved folder available on their website... which is all WoD material. So a CofD fansite cannot be in compliance with the official fansite guidelines if it even wants to use the logo for the baseline game. If they don't have the concern to let CofD fansites use the gameline skulls in their fansite rules... I highly doubt a far bigger task in the form of a CofD Vault is happening any time soon, if at all (unless WW lets Onyx Path take over this for them).</div> </div> </div> </div> The flip side of that is I don't they will bother anyone who ignored the rule and puts the skull on, because they can't be bothered to prosecute (warning not legal advise).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T08:02:55-07:00","id":1151010,"title":"","content":"I don't think so. It seems something they'd like to keep just for their 'One World of Darkness.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T16:03:56-07:00","id":1151141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151004#post1151004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The flip side of that is I don't they will bother anyone who ignored the rule and puts the skull on, because they can't be bothered to prosecute (warning not legal advise).</div> </div> </div> </div>The art restrictions are so bad most WoD fansites are in violation of them... because the fansite rules are dumb (and possible unenforceable anyway). It is, however, an utter pain because if you want to use the Dark Pack fansite tag to help promote your site, you've got to follow those rules. Even if they don't go after CofD sites, it's still (like the ST Vault) a resource where the uneven promotion is bad for their own profits.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151010#post1151010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think so. It seems something they'd like to keep just for their 'One World of Darkness.'</div> </div> </div> </div>However much WW disappoints me, I prefer we try to be accurate in our disapproval. The ST Vault is for any VtM edition, not just their new upcoming one. You can publish things in the ST Vault that are for the old school original WW style games, rather than their new One WoD approach.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T22:05:33-07:00","id":1151212,"title":"","content":"Not a snowball's chance in hell. Martin has said he views CofD as a failure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T22:34:13-07:00","id":1151215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151212#post1151212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not a snowball's chance in hell. Martin has said he views CofD as a failure.</div> </div> </div> </div>...the failure that the company still allows to exist as is with little to no direct input from them?<br /> <br /> Ok then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T22:56:12-07:00","id":1151218,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151215#post1151215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...the failure that the company still allows to exist as is with little to no direct input from them?<br /> <br /> Ok then.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, just repeating what the man himself said. There's a reason he has almost no involvement in it CofD and there's no multimedia support planned for the lines.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-20T00:28:22-07:00","id":1151233,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151218#post1151218\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hey, just repeating what the man himself said. There's a reason he has almost no involvement in it CofD and there's no multimedia support planned for the lines.</div> </div> </div> </div>And considering where CofD stands now I don\u2019t think his words hold as much weight as you are suggesting. <br /> <br /> \u201cFailure\u201d does not suggest \u201ca product we do not want to personally and directly supervise\u201d. Usually if a product is called a \u201cfailure\u201d it\u2019s usually one that has a short life span and is quickly canceled or \u201cshelved\u201d. <br /> <br /> Y\u2019know, like what happened to Mass Effect this year because of Andromeda. <br /> <br /> Otherwise if we take Ericsson at his word of CofD being a \u201cfailure\u201d, why the hell is it still getting books, with several upcoming 2nd Edition updates in varying stages of production? <br /> <br /> Besides even if that wasn\u2019t the case, it makes sense why a CofD ST Vault ISN\u2019T a priority right now. We really only have the one gameline in Vampire (yes I count DAV as being apart of one gameline: doesn\u2019t matter if they take place in different time periods, you still play as blood sucking creatures of the night that still use the same core gameplay mechanics). They still got 7 gamelines to add to the Vault before they could even consider adding CofD stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-20T03:07:10-07:00","id":1151257,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151212#post1151212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not a snowball's chance in hell. Martin has said he views CofD as a failure.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unless there's an interview or video from a convention I'm not aware of, that's a bit misleading.<br /> <br /> He said that the CofD failed to sell enough to catch on and be as mainstream (for RPGs at least) as the WoD; which was the deciding factor in which to pursue as the new WW's primary product.<br /> <br /> AFAIK he's never flat out called the CofD a failure, and has actually repeatedly acknowledged that essentially in a vacuum the CofD games are better games than the WoD games. But that the CofD failed to meet the criteria for the game they wanted to move forward with.means that it's a failure in one specific context. He's even clarified the interview I think we're talking about to acknowledge that the CofD's poor sales and reception in certain areas were directly impacted by forces beyond the game creators' control (the crash of the RPG bubble making it harder to sell in stores, harder to get published in multiple languages, etc.).<br /> <br /> Again, I'm very unhappy with WW in general, but I'd rather try to be accurate in what I'm angry about. In this specific case, I actually find it more frustrating. If Martin thought the CofD was shit, and that's why WW isn't supporting it in specific ways that they're supporting the original WW out of print games, I'd dislike it, but I'd find the company's actions more understandable even if I consider them wrong. Saying that you like the CofD while you're running the company that owns it, and then denying it access to digital resources pisses me off far more. It's pretty damned hard to reconcile someone liking a game (that they own the publishing rights to!), with someone that's ultimately responsible for fansite rules that over zero support for said game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-20T05:23:00-07:00","id":1151274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151212#post1151212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not a snowball's chance in hell. Martin has said he views CofD as a failure.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> When and where and why does he think its a failure ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-20T23:47:19-07:00","id":1151587,"title":"","content":"The more I hear about the new WW and their new owners the less I want anything to do with them and the more I think they'll be the huge failures. I support Onyx Path and the Chronicles of Darkness 100%. I would love for Onyx Path to set up their own Storyteller's Vault. I have so much I want to write up for Requiem, but I don't want to wait 10 years for the people at WW to get off their incompetent keisters and set up the CoD section of their Storyteller's Vault. I really wish WW had never come back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13542-shadowdragon","name":"Shadowdragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T01:43:23-07:00","id":1151598,"title":"","content":"Maybe some day, maybe somehow Onyx Path gets the IP to Chronicles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T09:34:18-07:00","id":1151660,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151598#post1151598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe some day, maybe somehow Onyx Path gets the IP to Chronicles.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have my doubts that another company could pull another Paizo in this day and age.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T10:11:56-07:00","id":1151670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151660#post1151660\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have my doubts that another company could pull another Paizo in this day and age.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that's the biggest obstacle. No one wants to own goal themselves like WotC did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T10:38:24-07:00","id":1151675,"title":"","content":"Technically, WW doesn't have to give up ownership of the CofD or Exalted to let Onyx Path have more power over these things.<br /> <br /> WW already allows Onyx Path to sell licensed products through distribution systems that WW isn't using (IPR and Red Bubble for example).<br /> <br /> Assuming Rich wants the responsibility involved, nothing stops WW from giving him the authority to set up and manage a CofD Vault (with their oversight to whatever level they want to enforce) for them instead of doing it themselves. This is goes right back to the frustration I voiced above. If the people running WW view the CofD as both something with strong creative value, and something worth continuing to sell for profit even through a licensee, why do they kneecap it by not handing things to Onyx Path if they're not going to do them? Sure a CofD Vault run by Onyx Path would mean less overall profit for WW (one assumes such a thing being run by Onyx Path would mean both get a cut in some fashion), but a business should weigh the time it would take to realize that money vs. the potential of years of lower profit lost sitting on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T11:31:43-07:00","id":1151694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151660#post1151660\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have my doubts that another company could pull another Paizo in this day and age.</div> </div> </div> </div>Happened before, can happen again. Take Nintendo and Sony.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T12:39:34-07:00","id":1151715,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151675#post1151675\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Technically, WW doesn't have to give up ownership of the CofD or Exalted to let Onyx Path have more power over these things.<br /> <br /> WW already allows Onyx Path to sell licensed products through distribution systems that WW isn't using (IPR and Red Bubble for example).<br /> <br /> Assuming Rich wants the responsibility involved, nothing stops WW from giving him the authority to set up and manage a CofD Vault (with their oversight to whatever level they want to enforce) for them instead of doing it themselves. This is goes right back to the frustration I voiced above. If the people running WW view the CofD as both something with strong creative value, and something worth continuing to sell for profit even through a licensee, why do they kneecap it by not handing things to Onyx Path if they're not going to do them? Sure a CofD Vault run by Onyx Path would mean less overall profit for WW (one assumes such a thing being run by Onyx Path would mean both get a cut in some fashion), but a business should weigh the time it would take to realize that money vs. the potential of years of lower profit lost sitting on it.</div> </div> </div> </div>It seems obvious to me:<br /> <br /> Right now nu-WW's priority is getting WoD5e up and running.<br /> <br /> Since, you know, VtM5e isn't even officially out right now. Of course backing CofD on their end isn't a priority for them right now.<br /> <br /> Or to take it another way: so far only VtM has a Storyteller's Vault right now. So far nothing has been said about WtA or MtAs getting an ST Vault, nevermind on if WtO, CtD, or HtR will ever get one. Seems a bit early to be talking about a CofD Vault.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151694#post1151694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Happened before, can happen again. Take Nintendo and Sony.</div> </div> </div> </div>...the one where Nintendo and Sony announced a partnership together, Nintendo turning around and canceling that partnership the next day, to partner their rival Phillips instead? For an add-on that never materialized?<br /> <br /> You mean the thing that happened only once in video game history and hasn't happened again in that magnitude?<br /> <br /> Yeah. Sure pal. Ok then. Next you'll be telling me that we have another video game crash is coming because the industry right now kinda-sorta-resembles the circumstances of the industry right now.<br /> <br /> ----------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> Point is: don't count on OPP exploiting some weird legal loophole that allows them to just take full control of the CofD license and just running off with it in the sunset with nu-WW being unable to do anything about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T13:21:52-07:00","id":1151725,"title":"","content":"My point though, is that WW doesn't actually have to do it. WW can just ask Onyx Path to do it, so WW can keep focusing on the WoD. Yes, their priority is the WoD, and since they made that decision, it should remain their priority. But that doesn't mean they should give up on support and profit regarding the CofD for things that require minimal effort on their behalf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T20:37:31-07:00","id":1151841,"title":"","content":"Or, or, just buy the IP.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T02:32:55-07:00","id":1151885,"title":"","content":"I'd love to see it happen, but why would they? They make money just for owning it as long as Onyx Path does all the hard work of making the games. Someone would need to offer them a rather considerable amount of money, and successfully negotiate a non-compete agreement regarding the overlapping natures of the two.<br /> <br /> It's just not a reasonable expectation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T07:41:04-07:00","id":1151932,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151841#post1151841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or, or, just buy the IP.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> How much would that cost ?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T12:38:12-07:00","id":1151997,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151725#post1151725\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My point though, is that WW doesn't actually have to do it. WW can just ask Onyx Path to do it, so WW can keep focusing on the WoD. Yes, their priority is the WoD, and since they made that decision, it should remain their priority. But that doesn't mean they should give up on support and profit regarding the CofD for things that require minimal effort on their behalf.</div> </div> </div> </div>My thing is: do we really NEED an ST Vault for CofD right now?<br /> <br /> My understanding right now is that both OPP and the community are chomping at the bit for the remaining 2nd edition updates. And on this site, people saying that they're hesitating to push forward with new homebrew stuff because they want to see what 2nd edition updates provide. And OPP, from my understanding, also has put getting those 2nd edition updates out as a priority. So even if they did have the go-ahead from nu-WW to release an ST Vault for CofD...would they do that right now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T13:05:30-07:00","id":1152000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1151997#post1151997\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My thing is: do we really NEED an ST Vault for CofD right now?<br /> <br /> My understanding right now is that both OPP and the community are chomping at the bit for the remaining 2nd edition updates. And on this site, people saying that they're hesitating to push forward with new homebrew stuff because they want to see what 2nd edition updates provide. And OPP, from my understanding, also has put getting those 2nd edition updates out as a priority. So even if they did have the go-ahead from nu-WW to release an ST Vault for CofD...would they do that right now?</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering the amount of people who stay devoted to first edition, which is no longer going to be supported, sure. Plus there's people who want to make their own 1.5 or second edition rules, we already have five games out in second edition to bank on as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T16:27:01-07:00","id":1152056,"title":"","content":"Also, who said anything about &quot;right now?&quot;<br /> <br /> If Onyx Path waits until 2e is completely out... it's what... 2-3 years at worst? CtL 2e is supposed to be ready for a Kickstarter in a few weeks, HtV 2e is supposed to be far enough along for one or just coming out soon into next year. Geist 2e is in development, so it could easily be out by the end of next year (we haven't heard much, but Geist has the least material to update). Mummy is the only one not actively in 2e update development, so that would be the hold out and if it takes a lot of time, again, that's why my worst case above is 3 years (though that is exceedingly long considering the current speed of things and new games at the same time).<br /> <br /> And, they don't have to wait. They can do all of 1e and whatever's updated for 2e at start, plus 2e as it rolls out. WW still hasn't rolled out all of VtM yet. CofD fans that want something like this want it soon, not whenever WW gets around to it - if they do - once they're more settled with their production of their new WoD material, which could easily be a decade from now. Everyone knows Onyx Path couldn't do it tomorrow if WW signed off on it this second and worked it in to Onyx Path's existing licensing fee to them without renegotiating the terms. It takes some time to set up. Guideline documents have to be written. Layout and art elements need to be collected. Etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-23T11:32:19-07:00","id":1152244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1152056#post1152056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, who said anything about &quot;right now?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Because your posts have a tone of urgency to them. Suggesting that you feel a CofD ST Vault SHOULD be rolled out &quot;right now&quot;. Especially since, later on you, write stuff like:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> CofD fans that want something like this want it soon, not whenever WW gets around to it </div> </div> </div>So yeah. Sounds like people do want an CofD ST Vault now rather then later.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Geist 2e is in development, so it could easily be out by the end of next year (we haven't heard much, but Geist has the least material to update). </div> </div> </div>From my understanding that's...not true.<br /> <br /> Apparently it was acknowledged that Geist1e was a complete mess mechanically. And as such demands a big overhaul, the most extensive one out of all the CofD lines getting 2nd edition updates. Since, you know, it didn't help that Geist1e didn't have a whole line of supplemental material for the devs to build upon. .<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-23T13:44:37-07:00","id":1152285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1150942-will-we-get-a-storyteller-vault-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1152244#post1152244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because your posts have a tone of urgency to them.</div> </div> </div> </div>My posts are text, which is very unreliable for communicating tone. It seems like you're stretching very hard to read &quot;urgency&quot; into words that don't say such things.<br /> <br /> For instance, &quot;soon&quot; does not mean, &quot;right now.&quot; It acknowledges that time needs to pass before something happens. It is simply a statement of wanting it sooner than <b>both of our</b> assumptions about how long it would take for WW to get to it (note: when you're going to talk about tone in a pure text communication, consider you said something to me without any acknowledgement that I brought up the exact same point on the previous page, it doesn't lead to inferences that you're paying enough attention to my posts to really assess the tone).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> So yeah. Sounds like people do want an CofD ST Vault now rather then later. </div> </div> </div>I'm sure there are. But there's a difference between wanting it now, and expecting it now (or even demanding it now). I want the last of the of 2e core book updates now, but I'm not deluded as to the fact that it will take time and happen later. But I'm also mollified by the progress made and blog posts written that we'll be getting them soon.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Apparently it was acknowledged that Geist1e was a complete mess mechanically. And as such demands a big overhaul, the most extensive one out of all the CofD lines getting 2nd edition updates. Since, you know, it didn't help that Geist1e didn't have a whole line of supplemental material for the devs to build upon. .<br /> </div> </div> </div>I think that's more of a bonus to development than not. We've seen the other game lines that have been updated have to consider what from those supplements should be moved to core book status, and have to consider how to build the new cores so that such supplements can be revisited as well. The bigger the supplement catalog is, the more the developers have to consider.<br /> <br /> But we'll see I guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}